text:
@jcokechukwu These are not bunker busting bombs, they are GBU-31 and GBU-24, 2000 lbs class wps , most with a delayed fuse.

Bunker busters would delay the fuse long enough to reach the basement, then detonate. The bldg would fully collapse. 5k lbs class, or more. 

Either way, devastating

